            "text": "<h2>Custom Residential Wallpaper & Wall Murals<br/><br/></h2><p>Our custom residential wallpaper and wall murals are designed specifically for homes, making it easy to transform any space with confidence. Every wallpaper is <strong>printed to your exact wall measurements</strong>, eliminating excess material and ensuring a clean, professional, made-to-measure finish.</p><p>Choose from our curated wallpaper collections or create a custom wall mural using your own image or design. With <strong>live previews before printing</strong>, precise pattern resizing, and eco-certified materials, you can see exactly how your wallpaper will look and feel before it’s produced. The result is custom wallpaper that fits your wall perfectly and complements your home’s style—without guesswork or waste.</p>",
